# wevents: reports each window event it reads, one line an event (the interval, the modifiers, the event, its place, its queue words); the script
# types a, clicks, and ends it with control-d. The interval and the upper word of the y queue entry are the X server's clock: masked (ALL.mask).
move 100 100
key a
wait
click 1 100 100
wait
keydown Control_L
key d
keyup Control_L
